# OpenLane run trees.
#
# Two failures live here, and the reason they happened is the same. Both trees
# had a blanket `runs/` ignore added AFTER the files were committed, so the rule
# never protected them: 758 MB of Yosys/OpenLane intermediates went in, and
# .gitignore could not stop them because it never matched the path. Untracking
# alone would not have shrunk a push either -- the blobs stay in history -- so
# both needed `git filter-repo`. See pixi.toml for the dependency.
#
# What the rewrites KEPT, and why the rules below are these specific patterns:
#   * all 5 runs' resolved.json, flow.log, error.log, warning.log
#   * 283 .rpt timing reports + 3 .drc reports  (the PPA/DRC/antenna numbers)
#   * mul48_kernel.gds  (the "GDS 0.119 mm2, DRC/antenna clean" deliverable)
#   * mul48_kernel.lef
# Ignoring each whole runs/ tree instead would silently un-track that evidence
# on the next `git rm -r --cached`. Tracked files are unaffected by .gitignore,
# so these patterns govern only what gets ADDED next.
hdl/openlane/runs/

# ldl: Yosys intermediates (39.6 MB)
hdl/openlane/ldl/runs/*/tmp/
hdl/openlane/ldl/runs/*/05-yosys-jsonheader/

# mul48: OpenDB/magic/routing intermediates (620 MB), plus the two redundant
# GDS renders -- magic.gds and klayout.gds are the same layout as the kept
# mul48_kernel.gds and are dropped as duplicates.
#
# NOTE the DEPTH. gitignore's `*` does not cross `/` (git uses FNM_PATHNAME),
# unlike the fnmatch behind filter-repo's --path-glob. These files live at
# runs/<RUN>/<step>/<file>, so the patterns need two stars before the extension.
# A depth-2 pattern silently matches nothing -- which is the same class of bug
# as the missing ldl rule, and the reason this is worth stating.
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/tmp/
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/05-yosys-jsonheader/
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/*/*.odb
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/*/*.def
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/*/*.v
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/*/*.sdf
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/*/*.spef
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/*/*.mag
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/*/*.sdc
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/*/*.tcl
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/*/*.lib
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/*/*.guide
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/*/*.csv
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/*/*.tracks
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/*/*.vh
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/*/*.abc
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/*/*.png
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/*/*.vlt
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/*/*.txt
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/state_in.json
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/state_out.json
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/extra.json
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/*process_stats.json
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/*/*.log
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/*/*.yaml
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/*/*.xml
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/57-magic-streamout/mul48_kernel.magic.gds
hdl/openlane/mul48/runs/*/58-klayout-streamout/mul48_kernel.klayout.gds

*.vcd
*.gtkw

